# Keep the Docker build context small and hermetic: never ship host installs
# or build output — the image rebuilds them from the lockfile + sources.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
services/sds-parser/.venv
**/__pycache__
